### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy the curl lines from README.md
@base = http://localhost:4000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Analyse a batch (the assignment example)
POST {{base}}/monitor
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "api_name": "PatientDataAPI", "response_time_ms": 1200, "status_code": 200, "records_returned": 50 },
  { "api_name": "AppointmentAPI", "response_time_ms": 5500, "status_code": 500, "records_returned": 0 }
]

### Run the bundled static JSON file
POST {{base}}/monitor/sample

### Simulate 50 responses
POST {{base}}/monitor/simulate?count=50

### Active alerts
GET {{base}}/alerts

### Critical alerts only, searching "appointment"
GET {{base}}/alerts?severity=critical&q=appointment

### Resolved alerts
GET {{base}}/alerts?status=resolved

### Stats
GET {{base}}/alerts/stats

### Per-API health
GET {{base}}/monitor/apis

### System configuration
GET {{base}}/monitor/status

### Resolve one alert (replace the id)
PATCH {{base}}/alerts/REPLACE_ID/resolve

### E-mail a report of active alerts
POST {{base}}/alerts/report/email
